layout: template.njk
slug: estimate-flooring
title: Estimate template for flooring jobs (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable estimate form for flooring jobs. Area in square feet, material, tear-out, subfloor prep, trim, line items and total, with a line for the customer to sign. No account needed.
heading: Estimate for flooring
sub: Square feet, material, tear-out and trim on one page, with line items, a total and a line for the customer to sign when they say yes.
tips:
  - Write the area in square feet and how much extra you are ordering for cuts and waste.
  - Price tear-out and disposal of the old floor on their own line.
  - Subfloor problems may only show up once the old floor is up. Write how you will price a repair, for example per square foot.
  - Say who moves furniture and appliances. Put a date the price is good until, and have the customer sign and date it when they agree.
---
